# Runtime dependencies of the container image (Dockerfile), hash-pinned in
# docker.txt so the image build installs nothing unpinned (OpenSSF
# Scorecard Pinned-Dependencies). The package itself goes on with
# `--no-deps`. Mirrors pyproject [tool.poetry.dependencies]; the image is
# the core install, without the `online` extra.
# Regenerate (the image's Python, every Linux architecture):
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.14 \
#     requirements/docker.in -o requirements/docker.txt
